# Play test of Rig Seventeen (CIPlay rig_seventeen, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the boat landing
# at 37 -13.5 (1.3 m) and its ladder at 39.1 -13.8 up past the cellar deck (8 m) to the main deck (12.4 m); the wellhead
# at 42 -9; the lifeboat bay x 45..51 on the cellar deck, its fire door at x 45, z -10.5..-7.5; the pump room x 45..51 on
# the main deck, its door at x 45, z -9; valve three at 40 -5.5; the derrick x 40..43, z -13..-10; the ladder up to the
# control room (15.4 m) at 44.76 -12.5; the bridge at z -9 to the tank stack's top at 23 -9; the launch beach at -6 -30
island Rig Seventeen
expect step 0
expect title Cold Start
expect animals Goat 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect hidden fire1
expect hidden flare
expect hidden firedeck
wait 5

# The landing; up the ladder to the cellar deck: the handover; the bay's fire door is shut
zone landing
expect step 1
open Landing box
climb 39.1 -13.8 h=1.3
climb 39.1 -13.8 h=3.72
climb 39.1 -13.8 h=6.14
expect stand 40.5 -12 h=8 below=10
read Manager's handover
expect step 2
walk 42 -12 to 43.5 -9.5 to 47.5 -9 h=8 below=10 blocked
walk 41 -12.5 to 39.8 -13 h=8 below=10
wait 3

# Up to the main deck: the derrick's screechers; up to the control room: the manager's locker (the key)
climb 39.1 -13.8 h=10.98
expect stand 41.5 -11.5 h=12.4 below=14
zone derrick
kill Screecher
expect step 3
climb 44.76 -12.5 h=12.4
climb 44.76 -12.5 h=14.82
expect stand 48 -12 h=15.4 below=17
zone controlroom
open Manager's locker
expect story startkey 1
expect step 4

# Over the bridge to the tank stack for diesel; back to the control room: the checklist; the desk refused before it
walk 38.5 -9 to 34 -9 to 27 -9 h=12.4
zone tankstack
open Fuel store
expect story diesel 1
expect step 5
zone controlroom
use controldesk
expect message checklist
read Restart checklist
expect step 6

# The cold start: lights, the flare - then fire, smoke and the alarm; the bay's fire door opens
use controldesk
wait 8
expect shown riglights
expect shown flare
expect shown fire1
expect shown smoke
expect shown firedeck
zone firedeck
expect step 7
walk 41.5 -11 to 47 -10 h=12.4 below=14 blocked
walk 42 -12 to 43.5 -9.5 to 47.5 -9 h=8 below=10 blocked
use valve1
expect hidden fire1
expect story valvetag 1
expect step 8
use valve2
expect hidden fire2
expect story valvetag 2
expect step 9
use valve3
expect hidden fire3
expect story valvetag 3
expect step 10
walk 42 -12 to 43.5 -9.5 to 47.5 -9 h=8 below=10
zone lifeboatbay
expect step 11
use lifeboat
expect message locker first
open Lifeboat locker
expect step 12
use lifeboat
wait 8
expect done
# the valve test card: A open, B shut, C open (all start shut) - then the lever drops the crew stash
use riglever
expect message lever springs back
expect hidden rigstash
use rigpipeA
use rigpipeC
use riglever
expect shown rigstash
open Crew stash
